{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32020","headline":"崔卿池上双白鹭 · 贾岛","name":"崔卿池上双白鹭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹭雏相逐出深笼，顶各有丝茎数同。\n洒石多霜移足冷，隔城远树挂巢空。\n其如尽在滩声外，何似双飞浦色中。\n见此池潭卿自凿，清泠太液底潜通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}